@startuml
' Generate: plantuml -tutxt docs/diagrams/idempotency.puml
' Labels stay ASCII: Hangul breaks column alignment in text output.
participant Client
participant Ledger
database DB
Client -> Ledger: deposit(key=T-001, 10000)
Ledger -> DB: record T-001 + entries
DB --> Ledger: OK
Ledger -x Client: response LOST
Client -> Ledger: deposit(key=T-001, 10000) RETRY
Ledger -> DB: seen T-001 before?
DB --> Ledger: yes
Ledger --> Client: ??? (error or first result: ADR)
@enduml
